ession, it looked more like a 3-3-4. {T:away:sub} announced a 4-2-3-1 and attacked in a 4-3-3: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-3-4 with the ball, 3-4-3 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 4-3-3 with the ball, 3-4-3 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the centre (25% of touches).","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the right wing (24% of touches)."],"impact":"Out of possession, {T:home:sub} defended higher (back line 27.7 m from goal, against 27.3 m; tournament average: 27.9 m). But the deeper block won: {T:away:sub} chose to wait, and the wait paid off."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Le pressing, c'était {T:home:sub} : un PPDA de 14,5, contre 18,4 en face. Comprendre : moins de passes laissées à l'adversaire avant de lui sauter dessus.","keys":["Réaction à la perte : {T:away:sub} récupère 37 % de ses ballons perdus en moins de 5 s, contre 19 %. Une meute."],"impact":"Presser ne suffit pas : encore faut-il que les ballons récupérés se transforment. Ici, ils ne l'ont pas fait."},"en":{"lead":"The pressing came from {T:home:sub}: a PPDA of 14.5, against 18.4 for the opponents. Translation: fewer passes allowed before jumping on the ball.","keys":["Reaction to losing it: {T:away:sub} win back 37% of lost balls within 5 s, against 19%. A pack."],"impact":"Pressing is not enough: the regained balls still have to turn into something. Here, they did not."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"Choc des philosophies : {T:away:sub} (+1,00) jouait autour du ballon, {T:home:sub} (−0,58) tenait ses postes.","keys":["Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : Mykola Matvienko, impliqué dans 114 passes entre titulaires.","{T:away:Sub} : 61 % de passes courtes (moins de 15 m), contre 54 % en moyenne.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : Florian Grillitsch, impliqué dans 104 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"Et cette fois, c'est le football relationniste qui l'emporte. Ce n'est pas une loi, c'est un match."},"en":{"lead":"Clash of 